xperiment.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null,"figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_014_s5","report_id":"v3feat_014","text":"At epoch 3, Ours is 3.6 points better than EfficientNet (Figure 1(a)).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_014_s6","report_id":"v3feat_014","text":"At epoch 3, Ours achieves between 73% and 76% test accuracy (Figure 4).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_014_s7","report_id":"v3feat_014","text":"At epoch 2, Ours reaches its maximum test accuracy of 70.8%.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_014_s8","report_id":"v3feat_014","text":"BERT-base reaches 61% validation accuracy at epoch 1 (Figure 1(b)).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_014_s9","report_id":"v3feat_014","text":"Ours attains a validation accuracy of 63.7% at epoch 3.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_014_s10","report_id":"v3feat_014","text":"Figure 2 shows the results of this experiment.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_014_s11","report_id":"v3feat_014","text":"From epoch 2 to epoch 6, the validation accuracy of Ours improves by a relative 53.7% (Figure 2).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null,"figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_014_s12","report_id":"v3feat_014","text":"ResNet-50 attains a validation accuracy of 86% at epoch 4.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null,"figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_014_s13","report_id":"v3feat_014","text":"Ours attains a validation accuracy of 74.7% at epoch 10.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null,"figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_014_s14","report_id":"v3feat_014","text":"At epoch 6, the loss of ResNet-50 is 0.746.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null,"figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_014_s15","report_id":"v3feat_014","text":"Overall, the results are in line with what we expected from the literature.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null,"figure_id":null}]}